h may be purchased by interested eligible bidders upon the submission of a written application to the address below and upon payment of a nonrefundable fee of <B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">KSh. 1,000 (Kenya Shillings One Thousand only)</B> or equivalent in a freely convertible currency. The method of payment willbe <B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">Cash or Banker's Cheque.<SPAN style=\"COLOR: red\"><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></B>The bidding document will be collected from the below address upon production of a purchase receipt.</SPAN></SPAN></P>\n<P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=\"MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 28.35pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.35pt; mso-add-space: auto; mso-hyphenate: none; tab-stops: -.5in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-list: Ignore\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman\" data-mce-style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\" face=\"Times New Roman\">6.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman\" data-mce-style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt\">Bids must be delivered to the address below on or before <B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">12.00 Noon East African Time on November 17, 2015.</B></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> <B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt\">The packages should be clearly marked; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold\">Nairobi Bulk Water Supply: </SPAN></B></SPAN><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\" size=\"3\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: medium;\">Construction of Raw andTreated Water Gravity Mains from Thika Dam to Kigoro Treatment Works to Gigiri Tanks</SPAN></SPAN>